{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Child is an explosive new futuristic action-adventure game built by a small and passionate indie team. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a mysterious alien world full of unique environments, populated by dangerous alien foes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953070/extras/3446affee21072f8ff6aa712deaed39d.poster.avif?t=1772912240\" width=560 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953070/extras/3446affee21072f8ff6aa712deaed39d.webm?t=1772912240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953070/extras/3446affee21072f8ff6aa712deaed39d.mp4?t=1772912240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer a variety of bosses, each one designed to have a unique visual and gameplay style.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secret areas, find new weapons, enhance your abilities, and destroy any obstacles in your way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953070/extras/11be3d248c8c447520a71ec8907e7d6c.poster.avif?t=1772912240\" width=560 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953070/extras/11be3d248c8c447520a71ec8907e7d6c.webm?t=1772912240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953070/extras/11be3d248c8c447520a71ec8907e7d6c.mp4?t=1772912240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling a bit overwhelmed by it al